VDR Plugin 'ohpvstatus' Revision History
----------------------------------------

2026-11-xx: Version 0.5.0

- New optional line "PV Today" with the PV energy of today (--pv-today),
  shown below the SoC in Wh or kWh like the power values.
- Four free lines for any item (--line1..4) with their own label
  (--label1..4) and decimals (--decimals1..4), e.g. for the autarky of
  today. A number is shown with the unit openHAB sends, a text
  state as it is. Optional lines are only shown if an item is given.
- Wh, kWh, MWh and mWh are converted to Wh. Units that only end in W or Wh
  (e.g. "ct/kWh") are left as they are.

2026-10-21: Version 0.4.0

- Reviewed and reworked by Claude Opus (Anthropic) on behalf of Frank Neumann.
- The items are fetched in a background thread while the status menu is open,
  the OSD and the remote control no longer block while openHAB is slow or not
  reachable.
- One HTTP connection for all items, the fetch stops at the first connection
  error, a running request is aborted when the menu is closed.
- Item states with units are converted (W, kW, MW, mW, %), the number is read
  independent of VDR's locale (a German locale turned "1234.5" into 1234 and
  "0.85" into 0).
- Missing or invalid items (NULL, UNDEF, wrong name, HTTP 404) are shown as
  "n/a", "openHAB not reachable" only appears if openHAB does not answer.
- New option --token for openHAB instances that require an API token.
- Setup page opened with the blue key now saves to setup.conf.
- Setup values from setup.conf are checked (interval 1-300 s).
- --grid-in/--grid-out and --bat-in/--bat-out are checked to come in pairs.
- curl is initialised once in Initialize(), string copies always terminated.
- German translation: umlauts, plugin description translated, file renamed
  to po/de_DE.po like in other VDR plugins.
- Added README, HISTORY and COPYING.

2026-04: Version 0.3.0

- First version, written by Claude Sonnet (Anthropic) on behalf of Frank
  Neumann as an experiment in AI-assisted software prototyping.
- Shows PV production, house consumption, battery charge/discharge, battery
  state of charge with a bar and grid import/export from openHAB.
- Host, port, SSL and items on the command line, update interval, unit and
  invert switches in the setup menu.
- Grid and battery either as one signed item or as two separate items.
